====== netis WF2881 ======

{{ :media:netis:wf-2881.jpg?300|}}

A gateway manufactured by [[http://netiskorea.com/|Netis Korea]] aimed for the South Korean market and is currently only sold via the auction site [[http://global.gmarket.co.kr/|GMarket]] (available in english)

The router was also available on eBay, but is temporarily unavailable:

[[http://www.ebay.com/sch/i.html?_nkw=netis+wf2881|eBay (US)]] with OpenWrt pre-installed.

[[http://www.ebay.co.uk/sch/i.html?_nkw=netis+wf2881|eBay (UK)]] with OpenWrt pre-installed.

It's similar to other platforms based on the Mediatek MT7621A SoC with the exception that it comes with 128Mbyte of flash memory.


